# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Secrets — NEVER commit these.
#
# The credential bundle that came with the BBVA documentation contains the
# client secret and the RSA signing key in plaintext, in several places. They
# are excluded here, but exclusion is not remediation: those values have
# already circulated and should be rotated with BBVA.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.pem
*.p8
*.pfx
*.key
credenciales.txt
credenciales.zip
**/00.CREDENCIALES/
**/P8/
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
appsettings.Local.json
appsettings.*.Local.json
api-clients/**/environments/*.local.bru
api-clients/postman/*.local.json
# Bruno export from the BBVA bundle: embeds the real client_secret and private key.
03.BS_GRUPO/01.PROYECTO_BRUNO/API-PAY-BR.json

